<p id="S7.SS0.SSSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This research is funded by the National Nature Science Foundation of China (No. 62477010, No.62577022 and No.62307028), the Natural Science Foundation of Shanghai (No. 23ZR1441800), Shanghai Science and Technology Innovation Action Plan (No. 24YF2710100 and No.23YF1426100),Shanghai Qiji Zhifeng Co., Ltd. (2025-GZL-RGZN-01001) and the opening funding of the State Key Laboratory of DisasterReduction in Civil Engineering (Grant No. SLDRCE24-03).</p>
</div>
